<div style="--yw-gap:var(--yw-space-xs)" class="yw-stack">
<span style="color: var(--yw-fg)">Clients go first, so the servers never schedule onto an older client. <code>--yw-fg</code>
</span>
<span style="color: var(--yw-fg-muted)">Clients go first, so the servers never schedule onto an older client. <code>--yw-fg-muted</code>
</span>
